WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.330
What could be the cause of this massive
mosquito outbreak this year?

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.950
We ask Mr. Kafetch,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:08.990
a mosquito expert who has written
several books on the subject.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:10.970
Thank you for having me.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.990
Well, let me come right to the point.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.940
These mosquitos belong
to an entirely new species.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.040
Therefore, I know nothing about them.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:18.890
Get out of here!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.480
Ahem, excuse me.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.770
Now, let's take a look at the areas

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.940
- likely to be hit hardest by the outbreak.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.940
- Man, City Z's in their path.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.590
Now we've got a mosquito outbreak?

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.290
We interrupt this program
for breaking news.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.430
A large swarm of mosquitos
has been sighted in City Z.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.970
Mummified remains of attacked
farm animals have also been found.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.200
If you encounter a swarm of mosquitos,
flee immediately.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:38.650
This is an emergency evacuation warning.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:41.620
Threat level: Demon.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.940
No resident is to go outside
under any circumstances.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.980
I repeat...

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.260
No City Z resident
is to go outside...

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.930
Acquiring target.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.370
The

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.370
LONE CYBORG

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.900
Thanks to that warning,
they're all empty!

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.190
Like someone's gonna die
from a mosquito bite.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:44.750
What's losing
a little blood if I get all this?

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:50.820
The wind...?

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:57.780
What the--?!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:36.630
Come on, you guys.
That wasn't nearly enough.

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.510
Go get some more for me!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.140
Target acquired.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.090
I see.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:53.800
You make them suck the blood,
then take it all for yourself.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:57.790
You must be controlling the mosquitos
via some sort of signal.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.690
That would explain
their mysterious behavior.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.380
So if I were to get rid of you,
the leader,

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.330
would the swarm disperse too?

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.530
Our next meal is here.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.420
Go drain him dry.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.450
Incinerate.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.040
I'll eliminate you.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.960
So try no to move.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:40.600
You're going to eliminate me?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.660
Come on and try it!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.430
Did I get it?

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.100
Damn...mosquitos!!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.190
Incinerate.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.150
Maybe a leg next?

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.930
Wait, where are my legs?

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.460
Futile effort.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.980
I won't let you escape.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.290
What the hell is that guy?

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.460
He's gonna get me
if I don't do something now.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:18.270
The townspeople may
all be hiding...

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.450
but there are plenty
of animals around.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.750
Come here, little ones.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:29.780
Empty all your stored juices into me!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.130
So many.

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:41.150
If she's been collecting blood
from the whole town and beyond,

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.670
then it may not simply be
a food source for her.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.550
I should put an end to this
as soon as possible.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:49.990
Get back here, dammit!

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:53.320
You and I aren't done yet!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.750
What's with this guy?

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.470
It's in my mouth!
Pft! Pft! You little--!

00:07:59.510 --> 00:07:59.890
Huh?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.880
What's that squirming over there?

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:03.240
Huh? Mosquitoes?!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.610
You over there.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.650
Evacuate now.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.650
That swarm is conscious.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.370
If it senses you,
it will immediately attack.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:15.380
Seriously?

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.020
That's bad. I gotta get--

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:56.410
Since you spoke, I thought you would have
at least human-level intelligence.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.280
But, In the end, you were just a bug.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:02.580
You brought all the mosquitos together
into one, easy-to-burn swarm.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.120
When I spotted you,

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:09.290
I confirmed there were
no living beings within 500 meters,

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.120
so I should have been free to fire away.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.670
Wait, that guy might have--

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:18.180
Man, you saved me.
You're amazing.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:19.520
What was that just now?

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.680
You totally made them bug out!

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:22.810
Ba-dum-dum-tsh.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.450
Oh, I was just trying to make a joke
about the mosquitos being bugs, and...

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.440
Idiots!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.520
I no longer need the tiny ones.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:40.970
Because...

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.410
...look...

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.050
how strong I've become!!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:11.690
Can't your punches
kill a little mosquito?

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.260
Weakling!

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.290
Now I see.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:23.470
The more blood she consumes,
the more powerful she becomes.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:26.700
I think I'll have your head next!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:31.690
I let my guard down.
There's no chance of winning.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:35.670
All I can do is self-destruct.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.270
Forgive me, Doctor...

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.140
Mosquitos...suck!

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:54.730
Hold on!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.360
Please tell me your name!

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.730
Oh. It's Saitama.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.230
I'd like to be your disciple.

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.370
Oh, okay.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:10.210
Huh?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.330
Sensei!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.530
You really showed up.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.510
Uh...

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.530
It's "Genos," Saitama-sensei.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.510
Can you not call me sensei?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.240
Master!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.790
Not Master either!

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.960
Go back to your home after your drink.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.360
I'm not looking for disciples.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.210
Wait--you're back in one piece?

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.480
Yes, my body is mostly mechanical.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:00.590
As long as there are parts,
repairs are quick.

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:02.460
You're an odd one.

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:05.680
What kind of parts
do you use, Master?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.740
Don't use any.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.690
Then what about the
skin-colored armor on your head?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.070
Yeah, that's my skin.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.530
But that would mean you're bald
despite being so young.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:16.940
So I'm bald--what's your problem?!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:20.530
Me? You'll listen to my problems?

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.250
No thanks, I'm good.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:27.790
Actually, four years ago, when I was 15,
I was still a real human being.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.500
Did you hear what I just said?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.680
Although we had to pinch pennies,

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:37.250
my family and I lived
a peaceful and fairly happy life.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:43.010
But one day, a crazy cyborg went out of
control and attacked our town.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.460
The insane cyborg...

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:48.780
Most likely, a failed body modification
generated an irregularity in his brain.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.430
He destroyed everything in sight.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:54.860
Parks, schools, buildings, my house...

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.270
He even took my family's lives.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:01.580
Miraculously I survived,
but being only a weak 15-year-old,

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:04.700
I was alone and at the end of my strength
in a ruined town.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.700
That's when Doctor Kuseno happened
to pass through.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.920
Doctor Kuseno, a scientist for justice,

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:14.610
was on a mission to stop the destruction
caused by the rampaging cyborg.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:19.940
That's when I asked Doctor Kuseno to
perform body modification surgery on me.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:23.270
That's how I was reborn as a cyborg
who fights for justice.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:28.150
I promised Doctor Kuseno that one day
I would terminate the evil cyborg.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.300
I see--

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.180
It's been four years since that day.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:36.440
I'm now 19 and I've been wandering
from town to town eliminating evil.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.330
The number of monsters and criminal
organizations I have destroyed

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.570
are too many to count.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.800
But I have been unable to find any clues
about that insane cyborg

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.880
and have become increasingly
frustrated and restless.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.490
I find myself chasing a virtual image
of that cyborg

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.340
whenever I square off against
my enemies.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.530
Then last week, when that mosquito
monster appeared,

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:55.380
I let my concentration slip.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.890
I was convinced I could not lose to anything
but the rampaging cyborg,

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:02.680
so I neglected to even analyze the data
on my opponent and rushed to confront her.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.310
The result, as you know,

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.560
was that an opponent
with immense strength bested me.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.920
If you, Master Saitama,
had not been in the area,

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.560
I would have undoubtedly
been destroyed.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:13.210
Master, you saved my life.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.410
My life that was once saved by
Doctor Kuseno

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.760
has now been saved again by you,
Master Saitama.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:20.100
I feel the weight of that responsibility.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:24.160
I must not die before
destroying that cyborg.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:27.680
And to do that, I must continue
fighting evil as a righteous cyborg

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.700
until he appears before me one day.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.120
I need to get stronger.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.760
Last week,
when I saw your punch,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.230
I knew I had to study under you
as your disciple.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.840
If only I could be
as strong as you, Master Saitama!

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.120
I have an old enemy to defeat,

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.990
and the battle is not for me only.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:45.660
It's for my hometown,
and for Doctor Kuseno too.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.650
I realize I am still inexperienced.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.970
But right now,
I need enormous power

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.800
so I can eradicate
the greatest of evils!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.050
Doctor Kuseno is--

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.520
Enough, you idiot!
Shorten it to 20 words or less!

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.160
Mosquito Girl was defeated?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.110
With one punch, you say?

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:06.980
Well, she was merely
a prototype, after all.

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.600
Why is he naked?

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:13.780
Unknown.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:14.990
Well, whatever.

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:17.750
He'll make an excellent specimen.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.480
We shall study his physiology--
by force if necessary.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.300
Send a messenger
and invite him here,

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.980
to our "House of Evolution."

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.680
Master, here's the short version:

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:36.870
Please teach me the way
to become strong like you.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.690
- Genos...
- Yes!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.660
How old are you?

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:43.620
19.

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:45.140
So young...

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.540
I'm sure you'll surpass me in no time.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.080
Do you mean that?

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:53.820
I'm 25 now, but I was 22
when I started training in the summer.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.570
Sure, I'll teach you.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.780
But, remember, it won't be easy.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.240
Yes, sir!!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.960
Object approaching at high speed--
It's here!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:08.800
Huh?

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.450
My name is...huh?

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.970
Pay for my ceiling!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:20.770
So...

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:21.370
Hm?

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:25.230
It seems our advance agent,
Kamakyuri, is down.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.540
I can't sense him
with my telepathy anymore.

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:31.070
What? Wasn't he one of
our stronger guys?

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.070
There are two more outside.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.610
Master, leave them to me!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.180
Don't bust people's ceilings!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.430
Oh, never mind.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.540
Can't you guys just
come through the door?

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.010
M-Master!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.840
Don't worry, I'm good.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.630
I kinda feel like a...bamboo shoot.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.570
Elevated energy levels detected.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.480
A cyborg?

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:05.770
Could it be...?

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.900
You are not the target.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.090
What's going on? I can't see.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.340
You are in the way!

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.540
I have some questions for you.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.840
It would appear you're in
what they call a "tight spot."

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.890
Well done, Ground Dragon!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:43.060
GROUND DRAGON

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:43.390
It complicates things
if they put up a fight.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:44.430
Master!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.420
You dare to look away?

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.240
Quite courageous!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:10.820
I am the pinnacle of
the House of Evolution's science.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.950
I am Armored Gorilla.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.340
Your attacks have no effect on me.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.150
The "House of Evolution"?

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.820
What does it want with my master?

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.330
It is none of your business.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:27.370
And it is our rule that anyone who
oppose us, will be eliminated without fail.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:32.610
I must destroy you.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.450
Hey, bastard!

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.600
What's with that look?

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.360
Being underground keeps you cool,

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:48.370
but at the same time,
it's nice and warm.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.950
I'm feeling sleepy. So, could you go away?

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:57.220
It seems like I need to show you your place.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.450
Listen up! I'm gonna slice
your eyes out with these!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.510
Then we'll see if you resist!

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:07.320
The Beast King never
lets anyone off easy.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.820
Well, enough fooling around.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.940
If you wanna apologize,
now's your chance.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.910
You guys smashed my ceiling!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.690
Humph. Fine.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:25.610
Then behold the true power

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.390
- Aw man...
- of the Beast--

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.880
I got dirt in my belt.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.790
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.040
Let me just shake this out.

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:37.200
You done?

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.100
One sec.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:41.840
I'm done.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:48.340
Okay, then behold the true
power of the Beast King!

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.830
Lion Slash!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:00.480
You okay, Frog Man--

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.090
Outta the way, pissants!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.650
Such is the law of the jungle!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.470
And you're next!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.320
Wait! Don't kill him yet!

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.710
Lion Slash: Meteor Power Shower!!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:32.710
Consecutive...

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.090
Normal Punches.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:53.600
Oh.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.380
N-No one told me
he'd be like that!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.630
It's best we retreat now and regroup...

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.430
Found you!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:06.300
No waayyy!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Huh?

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:29.720
Answer the question or be eliminated.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:30.420
Your choice.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:33.650
It is you who will be eliminated.

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.000
You fool.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:39.080
I am the third most powerful
fighter in the "House of Evolution."

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:40.830
At your power level,

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:44.390
you will never beat the Beast King,
the second most powerful.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.690
You will be destroyed.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.430
You're talking about this guy?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.030
Apparently so.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:58.470
Look, I'm really sorry.

00:21:58.470 --> 00:22:00.700
I'll tell you everything,
just don't kill me!

